WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.446
Organic synthesis begins with an intended structure. A

00:00:04.446 --> 00:00:07.898
spectrum and an isolated sample decide what the

00:00:07.898 --> 00:00:08.486
reaction

00:00:08.486 --> 00:00:09.713
actually yielded.

00:00:15.175 --> 00:00:18.732
The UREP research investigated imidazopyridine

00:00:18.732 --> 00:00:19.505
chemistry,

00:00:19.505 --> 00:00:23.304
using synthetic strategies and characterization to

00:00:23.304 --> 00:00:25.659
develop candidate heterocycles.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:35.597
Chemical purity and structural assignment must precede

00:00:35.597 --> 00:00:38.690
confidence in a biological screening result.

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:46.197
Cytotoxicity readouts are starting points for

00:00:46.197 --> 00:00:49.399
investigating molecular activity; they cannot

00:00:49.399 --> 00:00:50.182
demonstrate

00:00:50.182 --> 00:00:52.490
anticancer efficacy in a patient.

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:01.266
The project record should preserve which compounds

00:01:01.266 --> 00:01:01.523
were

00:01:01.523 --> 00:01:04.289
made, what assays were performed, and which

00:01:04.289 --> 00:01:04.996
conclusions

00:01:04.996 --> 00:01:06.007
remain untested.

00:01:10.842 --> 00:01:13.984
The grant-supported heterocycle work follows the

00:01:13.984 --> 00:01:14.508
distance

00:01:14.508 --> 00:01:17.716
between designing a molecule, identifying it, and

00:01:17.716 --> 00:01:18.174
knowing

00:01:18.174 --> 00:01:19.396
whether it matters.
